{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-4", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "走上街道", "storyInfo": "阿奎拉的离世激起了互助会岛民的怒火，袭击计划准备就绪。克莱门莎发现纳乔状态不对，她与调查互助会的德鲁莎同步信息，商议对策。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$jealous_intro", "key": "$jealous_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉离开我们了……", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果不是因为她，我可能到现在还每天躲在家里，只敢晚上出门……", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是她推荐我进入打捞中心，虽然她总说这也不是什么好差事，但我知道如今已经好过之前的日子了。", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是为我们而死的。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她去执行了整个计划里最冒险的那一环，又为了不让审判庭查出我们而死在了狱中。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在，我们必须把事情做完。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯……", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果这孩子也自认是岛民的一分子，他就不会说出去。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔，你和阿奎拉一起长大，你也不希望她白死，不是吗？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯！过分了。", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我说的不是实话吗？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉的死，换来的不该是这些优柔寡断的疑虑。服软不会让伊比利亚重视我们，流血才会。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "流血……我们的计划里不包括直接对伊比利亚人动手！", "name": "哀恸的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可他们早就动手了。纳乔的手是怎么没的，你不清楚？被当街烧死、打死的那些人里，就没有你的家人朋友？", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "港都是我们的祖辈一手设计建造的，可哪怕它马上就要重见天日，伊比利亚人都想不起来这个事实。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一面当我们是招来灾祸的罪人，一面又想要把我们祖辈留下的遗产据为己有……那我宁愿让那座中心城区沉在海底。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错！", "name": "认同的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天，我们分头行动，目标是破坏给起重机供能的灯塔矩阵。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所有人把潜水服都准备好，我们从水下走，这样最快也最隐蔽。阿奎拉的位置，由我来替。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已经搭上了人命，我们就绝不能失败。", "name": "愤怒的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明白。", "name": "认同的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$storyendjp_intro", "key": "$storyendjp_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看起来更困惑了。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉是要袭击灯塔矩阵，破坏打捞计划……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也是，我其实不是没有察觉到。我只是骗自己，她在打捞中心卖力工作，是因为对未来的生活还抱有期望。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是我一直不愿意相信，她从始至终都只是在为破坏做准备。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "鲁菲纳奶奶当年做那些事的时候，我没有参与；阿奎拉做这些准备的时候，我也没有参与。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我以为这样，就可以少一点人受伤。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但其实，我什么都不做，所有事情一样都会发生，对不对？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉也好，鲁菲纳奶奶也好，她们永远不会停止挣扎。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以她们也永远都不会停止受伤。奶奶病死了，阿奎拉自杀了……我甚至都不知道自己在旁边什么都不做，是要避免让谁受伤。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我自己吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可我不想只有自己安然无恙。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯轻轻握住纳乔的右臂，烧伤的瘢痕狰狞地攀在苍白的肩膀上，格外扎眼。"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不是安然无恙，你受到过的伤害，每天都在以最直白的方式折磨你。但你还是可以决定，这些苦，你到底要为谁而受。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你可以加入那些岛民，成为反抗者的一员；你也可以抛弃他们，变成审判庭的助手。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不论你如何选择，纳乔，我向你保证，我都可以治好你的手臂。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "治好我的手臂……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g10_underseacorr", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你昨天没来打捞中心，我担心你的状况。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我本想找找帮得上阿奎拉的办法。但，已经不需要了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我很遗憾。审判庭会出具详细的事件说明，如果你想了解究竟发生了什么……当然，如果你想回避，我也理解。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会去看的。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "塔西塔告诉我，你来找我的时候，伤得非常严重，那现在——", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "纳乔", "content": "别碰！"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "纳乔", "content": "不……我的意思是它已经好了。"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个朋友懂些医术，帮我处理了这个问题。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是没事的话，我就先去工作了，克莱门莎监事。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她从口袋里掏出一枚很小的零件，放在纳乔完好无损的左手掌心上。"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔一眼就认出，那是他几天前在海中丢失的螺栓。"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你丢的螺栓……是阿奎拉找到的。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她被捕的时候，托人把这枚螺栓转交给你。无论她出于什么目的进行非法活动，她仍是了解你、在意你的。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "了解我……是啊。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，我跟您说过我的手是怎么没的，对吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，你被邻居恶意投掷的燃烧瓶所伤。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但这个故事其实还有前半段。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奶奶是建造港都的工人，伊比利亚本该给她褒奖。但大静谧之后，仅仅是不把她像其他岛民那样钉上灯柱，都成了伊比利亚的仁慈。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她前半生的所有心血，就那么被否认了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "于是她开始组织同样不满的岛民，想要证明岛民的清白、岛民的贡献、岛民的价值。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那一定不太顺利。我看到的，是他们的手段变得越来越激烈、越来越暴力。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到最后，似乎再也找不到别的办法了，他们开始摧毁岛民曾经亲手建设的东西——岛民亲手拉的电缆、亲手凿的水井、亲手培育的庄稼。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但他们只是引发了更大的恐惧，招来了更多的仇视。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个燃烧瓶……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#3$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原本是伊比利亚人用来烧死鲁菲纳奶奶的。万幸的是，那天她正巧外出抗议，直到深夜都没回来，睡在床上的只有我。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为了给我做假肢，奶奶忙活了一个月。可家里被审判庭搜查过太多次，能用的零件都不剩多少了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她捏着仅剩的那一枚螺栓，就那么怔怔地看着我。我不知道她是在愧疚，还是在难过。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "做完假肢之后，她就一病不起。临终前，她把我叫到床头，又像那样怔怔地看着我的手。我不知道她是在后悔，还是在遗憾。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但有一点我很确定。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她在这枚螺栓上看到的，和阿奎拉看到的一样，是仇恨。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g6_gdsquare_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loading_intro", "key": "$loading_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "互助会……只为疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人开门的教堂。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，这年头还有人会用这种说辞，看来他对自己的障眼法很自信啊。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小帮手，扫描附近街区是否有隐藏建筑。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_microrobot", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "指令无法识别。请先提供“隐藏”的定义。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啧，不能直接这样用吗……算了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已经绕了两个街区，岛民的目击报告也汇总好了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "假设互助会是他们所有行动的起点或终点，根据阿奎拉掉落的气瓶管的位置和上次抓捕行动的逃亡路线来看……", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可疑的路线一共有五条，排除会经过岗哨和审判庭临时驻扎地的，只剩三条……", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "查询中——刚才步行走过的三条路线中只有两处交会，一处是市集，而另一处是一座废弃工坊。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还行，总归比南多好用。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行了，帮我联系克莱门莎吧，我找到线索了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "联系克莱门莎。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……帮我联系打捞中心监事克莱门莎小姐。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_microrobot", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "收到指令。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是你本来就这么笨，还是克莱门莎给你惯的？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_transmissionget", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "group_interclude_vertical_common", "size": "290,760", "style": 0.0, "offset": "200,0", "channel": 3.0, "tsfrom": "0,1", "tsto": "1,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "德鲁莎教官。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳！克莱门莎监事，互助会的所在地可以锁定在两处。一处在城区东侧临海的废弃工坊，而另一处是在与广场相邻的市集之中。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但为了保证万无一失，我还需要更多线索。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "来不及了。我认为互助会的岛民很快就会行动。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你要我今晚就确认互助会所在地？不是不行。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我怀疑他们之中有人擅长法术，哪怕我们今夜就进行搜捕，大概率也很难找到他们，不过——", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们的行动会成为你进一步锁定位置的线索。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另外，目前我们尚不清楚他们的袭击目标究竟是打捞中心还是供能灯塔矩阵，审判庭的人手不够充足，如果贸然行动，反而会出差错。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然有风险，但现在我们已经将互助会所在地锁定在两处，将计就计或许也会有收获。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你觉得互助会的背后还有其他煽动者？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉是决绝的反抗者，如果互助会由她领导，他们不会拖到现在才行动。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我猜测，互助会背后还有一个更擅长谋划和安抚人心的人，而这样的角色不会跟随反抗队伍一起行动。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有意思，你想让我趁袭击者倾巢而出，直接去互助会所在地会会他？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "很危险，请务必小心。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白，不过接下来的行动……", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会向伊比利亚阁下同步我们的进展，让审判庭先保证巡逻组的正常运转，观察居住区的情况，优先保障伊比利亚民众的安全。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至于针对打捞计划的破坏行动，说实话，在阿戈尔当执政官的十五年中，我几乎每个月都会遇到类似的情况——", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈……我绝对不要回海里的那个“家”。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "r", "switch": "true", "pfrom": "220,0", "pto": "220,0", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是你不想，就不用回去。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "袭击的事，我会协助审判庭处理。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "switch": "false"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true", "tsfrom": "1,1", "tsto": "0,1", "tsduration": 0.5}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}